* LQL Watch Definition::    Registering a watch; rows and the diff.
* LQL Watch List::          @kbd{M-x cmacs-lql-watches}.
* LQL Watch Cost::          What a watch costs, and the rules that bound it.
* LQL Watch Callbacks::     What a callback may and may not do.
* LQL Watch Podomation::    A watch as a podomation event.
